%% title: `atm read`
%% summary: Single-message read with status-first selection.
%% commentary: This read path selects a candidate row from SQLite mailbox metadata, loads full content only for the chosen message, and writes back read/ack state through unified message-state persistence when display mutations are required.
%% sets: cli,client
flowchart TD
    A[atm read request] --> B["SQL: query_mailbox_metadata_rows
LEFT JOIN mail_messages + mail_message_states
filter team/agent
exclude deleted_at
exclude expired expires_at
return bounded metadata rows"]
    B -->|sql error| E1[Typed MailboxReadFailed or MailboxLockTimeout]
    B --> C["ATM selection
match message-id or newest eligible row
collapse logical-current thread view
apply sender/task/since/contains filters"]
    C -->|no match and no timeout| O0[Return no match]
    C -->|no match with timeout| W1[Wait and re-query metadata rows]
    W1 -->|timeout| E2[ReadTimeout]
    W1 -->|match found| D
    C -->|match found| D["SQL: load_message
read mail_messages row
LEFT JOIN mail_message_states
apply loaded state to envelope"]
    D -->|sql error| E3[Typed MailboxReadFailed]
    D --> M{display mutation needed?}
    M -->|no| O1[Return full message]
    M -->|yes| U["SQL: upsert_message_state
set read / ack state only"]
    U -->|sql error| E4[Typed MailboxWriteFailed or MailboxLockTimeout]
    U --> R[Re-query metadata rows and reload selected message]
    R -->|sql error| E5[Typed MailboxReadFailed]
    R --> O1
    A -. forbidden .-> F1[inbox JSON or summary file read]
